# Issue #5593 (B1): the duplicate that loses the first-create race adopts the winner's
# row; it never read the winner's writes, so it must not be born.
MODULE: WalDurability
ROW: LiveAdvance(l)
FILE: src/lattice/BPlusTree/Grains/BPlusLeafGrain.LiveCheckpoint.cs
DETECTORS: BPlusLeafGrainTests.An_activation_that_adopts_a_concurrently_created_row_is_not_born
SUMMARY: an activation whose write adopted a duplicate's row is decided as born

--- FIND
_liveAdvanceBorn = _liveAdvanceCleanCreate && _liveAdvanceCreatedRow;
--- REPLACE
_liveAdvanceBorn = _liveAdvanceCleanCreate;
--- END
